# Keep the Docker build context lean — only ship what the builder needs.

# VCS metadata + GitHub config
.git
.github

# Pre-built local binaries (the image builds its own)
/kbouncer
/kbounce
bin/
dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Runtime SQLite state — never bake into an image
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Tests + testdata — image only needs production code
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/

# Docs / examples / community contributions — not runtime inputs
docs/
community-profiles/
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
*.md
!README.md

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
